---
// BeautyAdvisorExhibit.astro - Semantic Search, Hybrid Re-Ranking & Apriori Bundling
---

<div class="exhibit-wrapper" id="beauty-advisor-exhibit">
  <div class="exhibit-header">
    <div>
      <span class="exhibit-tag">Exhibit 1.1: Retrieval and re-ranking pipeline</span>
      <h3 class="exhibit-title">FAISS Cosine Similarity + Hybrid Linear Scoring</h3>
    </div>
    <div class="text-xs status-note">
      <span class="status-dot completed"></span> Sub-15ms In-Memory Vector Search
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="sr-only">
    Diagram and metrics showing the AI Beauty Advisor search pipeline. Queries are embedded and matched against 1,472 product vectors in FAISS, re-ranked using 0.90 similarity, 0.075 keyword match, and 0.025 filter match, achieving P95 retrieval latency of 13.0 ms.
  </div>

  <!-- Pipeline Architecture Graphic -->
  <div class="pipeline-flow">
    <div class="pipe-step">
      <span class="step-num font-mono">01</span>
      <span class="step-title">Query Embedding</span>
      <span class="step-desc">all-MiniLM-L6-v2 vector</span>
    </div>
    <div class="pipe-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</div>
    <div class="pipe-step">
      <span class="step-num font-mono">02</span>
      <span class="step-title">FAISS IndexFlatIP</span>
      <span class="step-desc">1,472 items, Cosine top-K</span>
    </div>
    <div class="pipe-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</div>
    <div class="pipe-step highlight-step">
      <span class="step-num font-mono">03</span>
      <span class="step-title">Hybrid Re-Ranking</span>
      <span class="step-desc">0.90*Sim + 0.075*KW + 0.025*F</span>
    </div>
    <div class="pipe-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</div>
    <div class="pipe-step">
      <span class="step-num font-mono">04</span>
      <span class="step-title">Gemini 2.5 Flash</span>
      <span class="step-desc">Single structured JSON call</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Real Measured Evaluation Metrics -->
  <div class="eval-metrics-grid">
    <div class="eval-box">
      <span class="e-label">P50 retrieval latency</span>
      <span class="e-val font-mono">9.5 ms</span>
      <span class="e-ctx">Measured over 20 test queries</span>
    </div>
    <div class="eval-box">
      <span class="e-label">P95 retrieval latency</span>
      <span class="e-val alert font-mono">13.0 ms</span>
      <span class="e-ctx">Well within 150 ms SLA budget</span>
    </div>
    <div class="eval-box">
      <span class="e-label">Precision@5 relevance</span>
      <span class="e-val font-mono">66.0%</span>
      <span class="e-ctx">Category + skin-type intersection</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Apriori Routine Bundle Simulation -->
  <div class="apriori-preview">
    <span class="apriori-title">Pre-mined Apriori routine pairings (lift &gt; 1.2):</span>
    <div class="rule-pairs">
      <div class="rule-pair">
        <span class="cat-source">Primary: Cleanser</span>
        <span class="rule-arrow" aria-hidden="true">⇄</span>
        <span class="cat-target">Bundle: Treatment + Moisturizer (Lift: 1.34)</span>
      </div>
      <div class="rule-pair">
        <span class="cat-source">Primary: Face Mask</span>
        <span class="rule-arrow" aria-hidden="true">⇄</span>
        <span class="cat-target">Bundle: Moisturizer (Lift: 1.28)</span>
      </div>
      <div class="rule-pair">
        <span class="cat-source">Primary: Sun Protect</span>
        <span class="rule-arrow" aria-hidden="true">⇄</span>
        <span class="cat-target">Standalone (No qualifying rules, returns empty array)</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .exhibit-wrapper {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    padding: var(--space-6);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    margin: var(--space-6) 0 var(--space-8);
  }

  .exhibit-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  .exhibit-header > *:first-child {
    min-width: 0;
    flex: 1 1 auto;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .exhibit-header {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }
  }

  .exhibit-tag {
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .exhibit-title {
    font-size: var(--text-xl);
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  .status-note {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    color: var(--color-ink-muted);
  }

  .pipeline-flow {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    margin: var(--space-4) 0;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .pipeline-flow {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr auto 1fr auto 1fr;
      align-items: center;
    }
  }

  .pipe-step {
    background: var(--color-surface-subtle);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    padding: var(--space-3);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2px;
  }

  .pipe-step.highlight-step {
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
    background: var(--color-accent-subtle);
  }

  .step-num {
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .step-title {
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-ink-primary);
  }

  .step-desc {
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--color-ink-muted);
  }

  .pipe-arrow {
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--color-ink-muted);
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .eval-metrics-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    margin: var(--space-4) 0;
  }

  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .eval-metrics-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }
  }

  .eval-box {
    background: var(--color-surface-subtle);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    padding: var(--space-3);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .e-label {
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--color-ink-muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .e-val {
    font-size: var(--text-xl);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-ink-primary);
    margin: 2px 0;
  }

  .e-val.alert {
    color: var(--color-status-deployed);
  }

  .e-ctx {
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--color-ink-secondary);
  }

  .apriori-preview {
    background: var(--color-surface-subtle);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    padding: var(--space-4);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
  }

  .apriori-title {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-ink-primary);
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }

  .rule-pairs {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    font-size: 11px;
  }

  .rule-pair {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    padding: var(--space-1) var(--space-2);
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 2px;
  }

  .cat-source {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .rule-arrow {
    color: var(--color-ink-muted);
  }

  .cat-target {
    color: var(--color-ink-secondary);
  }
</style>
